note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note verify.om: the receipt verifier program. Built as `om2`, om/tls/sha2.om, receipt.om, verify.om;
note reads the receipt on stdin, run from the repository root. Contract and exit codes: receipt.om.

fn main to int
rc_reset
if ne rc_slurp 0
rc_reason 1
ret 2
end
ret int rc_run
end
